ound-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:80px 80px;pointer-events:none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 55%, rgba(248,225,142,0.25) 0%, rgba(248,225,142,0.10) 40%, transparent 70%);pointer-events:none"></div><nav class="relative z-50"><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1200px"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-6"><div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-4"><button type="button" aria-label="Search AI Engineer" title="Search AI Engineer (/ or ⌘/Ctrl+K)" class="inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-11 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-current/25 px-2.5 text-sm font-normal text-inherit transition-colors hover:bg-current/10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 text-white"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"></circle><path d="m16 16 5 5"></path></svg></button><a href="/" class="text-white/80 hover:text-white text-[14px] leading-[20px] md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px]">AIE Home</a><a href="/worldsfair/2026" class="text-white/80 hover:text-white text-[14px] leading-[20px] md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px]">World&#x27;s Fair 2026</a></div><button type="button" aria-label="Search AI Engineer" title="Search AI Engineer (/ or ⌘/Ctrl+K)" class="inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-11 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-current/25 px-2.5 text-sm font-normal text-inherit transition-colors hover:bg-current/10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 text-white lg:hidden"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"></circle><path d="m16 16 5 5"></path></svg></button><a class="flex items-center lg:absolute lg:left-1/2 lg:-translate-x-1/2" href="/worldsfair/2027"><img alt="World&#x27;s Fair" loading="lazy" width="124" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-10 md:h-14 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/worldsfair-white.cd2881ed.svg"/></a><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><a href="#updates" class="text-white hover:text-[#F8E18E] text-[14px] leading-[20px] md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] font-semibold">Get Updates</a></div></div></div></div></nav><div class="relative z-10 pt-12 md:pt-20 pb-16 md:pb-24"><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><div class="text-center"><div class="text-[#F8E18E] text-[14px] leading-[20px] md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-8" style="text-shadow:0 0 20px #F8E18E"><span class="hidden md:inline">JUNE 29 – JULY 1, 2027 • MOSCONE WEST, SAN FRANCISCO</span><span class="md:hidden">JUNE 29 – JULY 1, 2027 • SF, CA</span></div><h1 class="text-[44px] leading-[48px] md:text-[72px] md:leading-[72px] font-bold text-white mb-6 tracking-[-0.04em]">AI Engineer World&#x27;s Fair 2027<br/><span class="text-[#F8E18E]">Returns to Moscone</span></h1><p class="text-white/80 text-[16px] leading-[24px] md:text-[18px] md:leading-[28px] font-normal max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">After welcoming 7,500 attendees in 2026, we’re targeting 10,000 AI engineers, founders and technical leaders in 2027. Join us at Moscone West June 29–July 1 for technical tracks, workshops, an AI tools expo and conversations with the people building AI. Full program, speakers, and tickets announcing soon — join the list to be the first to know.</p><div id="updates" class="max-w-xl mx-auto scroll-mt-24"><div class="space-y-3"><form class="flex gap-3" method="dialog"><div class="flex-1 flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#2D2D2D] bg-[#1A1A1A] px-4 py-3 rounded-sm"><span class="font-jetbrains font-bold text-white text-[16px] leading-[24px]">&gt;_</span><input type="email" placeholder="ENTER YOUR WORK EMAIL ADDRESS" aria-label="Email Address" autoComplete="email" class="w-full bg-transparent text-[16px] leading-[24px] font-jetbrains text-white placeholder:text-white/40 focus:outline-hidden uppercase" name="emailAddress"/></div><button type="submit" class="border border-[#2D2D2D] bg-[#1A1A1A] px-6 py-3 rounded-sm font-jetbrains font-bold text-[16px] leading-[24px] text-white uppercase hover:bg-[#2D2D2D] transition-colors">Submit</button></form></div><p class="text-white/50 text-[12px] leading-[16px] mt-3">No spam. Just World&#x27;s Fair 2027 launch, CFP, and early-bird updates.</p></div></div></div></div><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><div class="mt-14 bg-black border border-[#2D2D2D] rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><div class="hidden md:flex"><div class="flex-1 px-6 py-5 text-center "><div class="text-[11px] leading-[16px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#F8E18E]/80 mb-2 whitespace-nowrap">Target attendance</div><div class="text-[22px] leading-[28px] font-bold text-white whitespace-nowrap">10,000</div></div><div class="flex-1 px-6 py-5 text-center border-l border-[#2D2D2D]"><div class="text-[11px] leading-[16px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#F8E18E]/80 mb-2 whitespace-nowrap">San Francisco, CA</div><div class="text-[22px] leading-[28px] font-bold text-white whitespace-nowrap">Moscone West</div></div><div class="flex-1 px-6 py-5 text-center border-l border-[#2D2D2D]"><div class="text-[11px] leading-[16px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#F8E18E]/80 mb-2 whitespace-nowrap">2027</div><div class="text-[22px] leading-[28px] font-bold text-white whitespace-nowrap">Jun 29 – Jul 1</div></div></div><div class="md:hidden flex flex-col px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 "><div class="text-[11px] leading-[16px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#F8E18E]/80">Target attendance</div><div class="text-[18px] leading-[24px] font-bold text-white whitespace-nowrap">10,000</div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 border-t border-[#2D2D2D]"><div class="text-[11px] leading-[16px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#F8E18E]/80">San Francisco, CA</div><div class="text-[18px] leading-[24px] font-bold text-white whitespace-nowrap">Moscone West</div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 border-t border-[#2D2D2D]"><div class="text-[11px] leading-[16px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#F8E18E]/80">2027</div><div class="text-[18px] leading-[24px] font-bold text-white whitespace-nowrap">Jun 29 – Jul 1</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="format" aria-labelledby="format-title" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#2D2D2D]"><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><div class="max-w-2xl mb-10"><p class="text-[#F8E18E] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4">The World&#x27;s Fair experience</p><h2 id="format-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">More of what brought us together</h2><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">The core format returns in 2027: deep technical content, hands-on learning and a place to meet the people building AI. The detailed schedule, track lineup, speakers and exhibitors will be announced.</p></div><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2D2D2D] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#F8E18E] mb-3">Technical tracks &amp; keynotes</h3><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Go deep on building and shipping AI alongside engineers and researchers. The 2026 program spanned agents, evals, inference, retrieval, multimodality and more; the 2027 track lineup is still to come.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2D2D2D] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#F8E18E] mb-3">Hands-on workshops</h3><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Work through practical techniques and tooling, with sessions for experienced developers getting into AI and engineers taking production systems further.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2D2D2D] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#F8E18E] mb-3">AI tools expo &amp; live demos</h3><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Meet the teams behind AI tools, models and infrastructure. Explore products, ask technical questions and see what is possible in live demos.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2D2D2D] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#F8E18E] mb-3">AI leadership</h3><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Join CTOs, VPs of AI and technical leaders to discuss building AI teams, choosing architectures and bringing AI into the enterprise.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2D2D2D] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#F8E18E] mb-3">Hallway conversations &amp; side events</h3><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Connect with engineers, founders and researchers between sessions and at community gatherings around San Francisco. The 2027 side-event calendar will follow.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2D2D2D] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#F8E18E] mb-3">Moscone West, San Francisco</h3><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed">Return to the same venue for a gathering built around learning, meeting collaborators and seeing the breadth of AI engineering in one place.</p></div></div><a href="/worldsfair/2026#schedule" class="inline-block mt-8 text-white underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#F8E18E]">Explore the 2026 schedule →</a></div></div></section><section id="past-editions" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#2D2D2D]"><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="text-[#F8E18E] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4">A look back · 7,500 attendees in 2026</p><div id="replay" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-3">Watch World&#x27;s Fair 2026</h2><p class="text-white/70 mb-6">Software Factories &amp; Keynotes — the 2026 livestream with Microsoft, OpenAI, OpenClaw, Z.ai, MiniMax and Hugging Face.</p><div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-black"><div class="h-full w-full" style="width:100%"><div data-youtube-embed="htM02KMNZnk" style="width:100%;height:100%"><noscript><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=htM02KMNZnk" aria-label="Watch World’s Fair 2026 — Software Factories &amp; Keynotes replay on YouTube">Watch &quot;<!-- -->World’s Fair 2026 — Software Factories &amp; Keynotes replay<!-- -->&quot; on YouTube</a></noscript><article class="yt-lite " data-title="World’s Fair 2026 — Software Factories &amp; Keynotes replay" role="img" aria-label="World’s Fair 2026 — Software Factories &amp; Keynotes replay - YouTube video preview" style="background-image:url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/htM02KMNZnk/hqdefault.jpg);--aspect-ratio:56.25%;width:100%;height:100%"><button type="button" class="lty-playbtn" aria-label="Watch World’s Fair 2026 — Software Factories &amp; Keynotes replay" tabindex="0"><span class="lty-visually-hidden">Watch</span></button></article></div></div></div><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=htM02KMNZnk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block mt-4 text-[#F8E18E] underline underline-offset-4">Watch the full replay on YouTube ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section id="community" aria-labelledby="community-title" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#2D2D2D]"><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><p class="text-[#F8E18E] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4">The people make the event</p><h2 id="community-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Meet your next collaborators</h2><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-8">A look at past AI Engineer events: technical sessions, conversations with builders and discoveries on the expo floor.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><figure><img alt="Attendees talking at an AI tools expo booth" loading="lazy" width="640" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full rounded-xl aspect-[8/5] object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/wf26/past-event-img-01.jpg"/><figcaption class="mt-3 text-white/80 text-sm">Meet the teams behind the tools</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt="A speaker in conversation on the World’s Fair stage" loading="lazy" width="640" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full rounded-xl aspect-[8/5] object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/wf26/past-event-img-09.jpg"/><figcaption class="mt-3 text-white/80 text-sm">Hear from the people building AI</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt="Attendees listening to a technical session" loading="lazy" width="640" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full rounded-xl aspect-[8/5] object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/wf26/past-event-img-10.jpg"/><figcaption class="mt-3 text-white/80 text-sm">Learn together, in depth</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt="Attendees connecting between conference sessions" loading="lazy" width="640" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full rounded-xl aspect-[8/5] object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/wf26/past-event-img-05.jpg"/><figcaption class="mt-3 text-white/80 text-sm">Keep the conversation going</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section id="venue" aria-labelledby="venue-title" class="border-t border-[#2D2D2D]"><img alt="Moscone West in San Francisco at night" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="764" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/wf26/moscone-west-night.jpg"/><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><div class="py-12 md:py-16"><p class="text-[#F8E18E] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4">June 29 – July 1, 2027 · San Francisco</p><h2 id="venue-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Back at Moscone West</h2><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Technical sessions, the expo and hallway conversations come together at Moscone West. Join a community that welcomed 7,500 attendees in 2026, with a target of 10,000 in 2027.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="join" aria-labelledby="join-title" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#2D2D2D] bg-[#F8E18E]/5"><div><div class="mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 h-full" style="max-width:1000px"><div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto"><h2 id="join-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Be part of World&#x27;s Fair 2027</h2><p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">Get launch, CFP and early-bird ticket updates, or explore sponsorship opportunities for your team.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4"><a href="#updates" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded font-bold bg-[#F8E18E] text-black hover:bg-white transition">Get 2027 updates</a><a href="mailto:sponsorships@ai.engineer?subject=AI%20Engineer%20World%27s%20Fair%202027%20Sponsorship" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded font-bold border border-[#F8E18E] text-[#F8E18E] hover:bg-[#F8E18E] hover:text-black transition">Become a 2027 sponsor</a></div></div></div></div></section><footer class="jsx-679538ed113dd93d conference-footer"><div class="jsx-679538ed113dd93d conference-footer__inner"><div class="jsx-679538ed113dd93d conference-footer__intro"><a href="/" class="jsx-679538ed113dd93d conference-footer__brand">AI Engineer</a><p class="jsx-679538ed113dd93d">Every AI Engineer conference, in chronological order.</p></div><div role="navigation" aria-label="All AI Engineer conferences" class="jsx-679538ed113dd93d conference-footer__list"><a href="/summit/2023"